          "anchor": "retiring-the-dead-capacitycapability-field-in-favor-of-capacitiesfor",
          "githubAnchor": "retiring-the-dead-capacitycapability-field-in-favor-of-capacitiesfor",
          "stableAnchor": "h-07aa53a5c95c"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Scope boundary with `tsk-45f`",
          "anchor": "scope-boundary-with-tsk-45f",
          "githubAnchor": "scope-boundary-with-tsk-45f",
          "stableAnchor": "h-2e4c0fb92a03"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "`execute` streams live output; `decide` never needed to",
          "anchor": "execute-streams-live-output-decide-never-needed-to",
          "githubAnchor": "execute-streams-live-output-decide-never-needed-to",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f41c4d91efa3"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Live proof: `fgos-coding-implement` really does dispatch out-of-process to `agy`",
          "anchor": "live-proof-fgos-coding-implement-really-does-dispatch-out-of-process-to-agy",
          "githubAnchor": "live-proof-fgos-coding-implement-really-does-dispatch-out-of-process-to-agy",
          "stableAnchor": "h-275ab4c5c420"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A configured cli-spawn capacity beats a live soul — config wins, not \"I can just do it myself\"",
          "anchor": "a-configured-cli-spawn-capacity-beats-a-live-soul-config-wins-not-i-can-just-do-it-myself",
          "githubAnchor": "a-configured-cli-spawn-capacity-beats-a-live-soul-config-wins-not-i-can-just-do-it-myself",
          "stableAnchor": "h-18cd47374451"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "`capabilities.<name>` gains `prefer`/`overrides`, replacing per-purpose duplicate capacity entries",
          "anchor": "capabilities-gains-preferoverrides-replacing-per-purpose-duplicate-capacity-entries",
          "githubAnchor": "capabilities-gains-preferoverrides-replacing-per-purpose-duplicate-capacity-entries",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f5ea7e215966"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The real gap self-review found: two independent lookups had to be unified",
          "anchor": "the-real-gap-self-review-found-two-independent-lookups-had-to-be-unified",
          "githubAnchor": "the-real-gap-self-review-found-two-independent-lookups-had-to-be-unified",
          "stableAnchor": "h-86abf3cff758"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A real operational snag: approve cannot run from inside an isolated worktree",
          "anchor": "a-real-operational-snag-approve-cannot-run-from-inside-an-isolated-worktree",
          "githubAnchor": "a-real-operational-snag-approve-cannot-run-from-inside-an-isolated-worktree",
          "stableAnchor": "h-5a5e8ff093b2"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Scope boundary: a raw tool call mid-turn (e.g. `WebSearch`) is not a dispatch at all",
          "anchor": "scope-boundary-a-raw-tool-call-mid-turn-eg-websearch-is-not-a-dispatch-at-all",
          "githubAnchor": "scope-boundary-a-raw-tool-call-mid-turn-eg-websearch-is-not-a-dispatch-at-all",
          "stableAnchor": "h-bafeeb7413c3"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "`fgos-coding-implement`'s own prose had gone stale about its own mechanism",
          "anchor": "fgos-coding-implements-own-prose-had-gone-stale-about-its-own-mechanism",
          "githubAnchor": "fgos-coding-implements-own-prose-had-gone-stale-about-its-own-mechanism",
          "stableAnchor": "h-67aa47c05fba"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A closing rename: \"capacity\" became \"executor\"",
          "anchor": "a-closing-rename-capacity-became-executor",
          "githubAnchor": "a-closing-rename-capacity-became-executor",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a7cbf0778fad"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Source",
          "anchor": "source",
          "githubAnchor": "source",
          "stableAnchor": "h-df707564d14b"
        }
