          "githubAnchor": "why-fgos-coding-plannings-mode-gate-moved-to-fgos-routing-and-gate-traceability-stayed-inline",
          "stableAnchor": "h-619a4b9cc06e"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What was explicitly rejected first",
          "anchor": "what-was-explicitly-rejected-first",
          "githubAnchor": "what-was-explicitly-rejected-first",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c383564f67f1"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "D1 — the mode gate moves before the skill loads, not inside it",
          "anchor": "d1-the-mode-gate-moves-before-the-skill-loads-not-inside-it",
          "githubAnchor": "d1-the-mode-gate-moves-before-the-skill-loads-not-inside-it",
          "stableAnchor": "h-5c4528113bdc"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "D2 — gate traceability discipline joins the existing Gate step, not a new skill",
          "anchor": "d2-gate-traceability-discipline-joins-the-existing-gate-step-not-a-new-skill",
          "githubAnchor": "d2-gate-traceability-discipline-joins-the-existing-gate-step-not-a-new-skill",
          "stableAnchor": "h-35177d3a73c6"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Outcome",
          "anchor": "outcome",
          "githubAnchor": "outcome",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4819655a6336"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Follow-up (`tsk-da1`): four real gaps left by the D1/D2 move",
          "anchor": "follow-up-tsk-da1-four-real-gaps-left-by-the-d1d2-move",
          "githubAnchor": "follow-up-tsk-da1-four-real-gaps-left-by-the-d1d2-move",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4fb4afc4acb0"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Second follow-up (`tsk-59a`): the mode→lane rename left a real regression, not just a docs gap",
          "anchor": "second-follow-up-tsk-59a-the-modelane-rename-left-a-real-regression-not-just-a-docs-gap",
          "githubAnchor": "second-follow-up-tsk-59a-the-modelane-rename-left-a-real-regression-not-just-a-docs-gap",
          "stableAnchor": "h-d1db9978a472"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Third follow-up (`tsk-5iv`): the same undefined-`$root` bug, in the sibling `fgos-coding-exploring` skill",
