          "anchor": "why-gate-bypass-is-shaped-the-way-it-is",
          "githubAnchor": "why-gate-bypass-is-shaped-the-way-it-is",
          "stableAnchor": "h-3f673227c3e5"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The actual problem wasn't \"let us auto-approve everything\"",
          "anchor": "the-actual-problem-wasnt-let-us-auto-approve-everything",
          "githubAnchor": "the-actual-problem-wasnt-let-us-auto-approve-everything",
          "stableAnchor": "h-69c79608f2ca"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why the skip criterion is mechanical, not a confidence read",
          "anchor": "why-the-skip-criterion-is-mechanical-not-a-confidence-read",
          "githubAnchor": "why-the-skip-criterion-is-mechanical-not-a-confidence-read",
          "stableAnchor": "h-45c493a42f05"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why there's still a human-set ceiling anyway (D5)",
          "anchor": "why-theres-still-a-human-set-ceiling-anyway-d5",
          "githubAnchor": "why-theres-still-a-human-set-ceiling-anyway-d5",
          "stableAnchor": "h-84bf7fc71ada"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why the floor (D4) never bends",
          "anchor": "why-the-floor-d4-never-bends",
          "githubAnchor": "why-the-floor-d4-never-bends",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1776d99c1235"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What this means for the next person extending it",
          "anchor": "what-this-means-for-the-next-person-extending-it",
          "githubAnchor": "what-this-means-for-the-next-person-extending-it",
          "stableAnchor": "h-d45d93ea87c9"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A mechanical check is only as live as the artifact it reads (tsk-5hg)",
          "anchor": "a-mechanical-check-is-only-as-live-as-the-artifact-it-reads-tsk-5hg",
          "githubAnchor": "a-mechanical-check-is-only-as-live-as-the-artifact-it-reads-tsk-5hg",
          "stableAnchor": "h-3f29827cca54"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The third gate needed a different axis, not the same one reused (D6, tsk-1ds)",
          "anchor": "the-third-gate-needed-a-different-axis-not-the-same-one-reused-d6-tsk-1ds",
          "githubAnchor": "the-third-gate-needed-a-different-axis-not-the-same-one-reused-d6-tsk-1ds",
          "stableAnchor": "h-12d22392c108"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A mechanical check is only as live as the branch importing it (D7/D8, `tsk-1vi`)",
          "anchor": "a-mechanical-check-is-only-as-live-as-the-branch-importing-it-d7d8-tsk-1vi",
          "githubAnchor": "a-mechanical-check-is-only-as-live-as-the-branch-importing-it-d7d8-tsk-1vi",
          "stableAnchor": "h-af4bddf3fd6a"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The global-install crash D8 split off (tsk-65q)",
          "anchor": "the-global-install-crash-d8-split-off-tsk-65q",
          "githubAnchor": "the-global-install-crash-d8-split-off-tsk-65q",
          "stableAnchor": "h-cd7067077b9a"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A bare-word marker scan created a perverse incentive to obfuscate (`tsk-3i8`)",
          "anchor": "a-bare-word-marker-scan-created-a-perverse-incentive-to-obfuscate-tsk-3i8",
          "githubAnchor": "a-bare-word-marker-scan-created-a-perverse-incentive-to-obfuscate-tsk-3i8",
          "stableAnchor": "h-d8ec9ee43368"
        }
