        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Primary Scrutiny Target #2 / MEDIUM — `runMissionAssignment`'s new mission-membership check protects only the string-ID call path; the object-form path (equally documented, `@param {string|object} assignmentOrId`) has zero mission-ownership verification",
