        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "New finding (not in the dispatch's named scrutiny targets, found via caller sweep) / MEDIUM — this cell's migration to the mission-agnostic inline shape silently reintroduces the exact `cli.mjs` gap P02.4 already fixed as a closed MEDIUM finding",
