        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM-1 — no test in this cell asserts the `actor` field of any node-operation binding; a swapped/wrong actor binding would pass every existing check silently",
          "anchor": "medium-1-no-test-in-this-cell-asserts-the-actor-field-of-any-node-operation-binding-a-swappedwrong-actor-binding-would-pass-every-existing-check-silently",
