          "stableAnchor": "h-b7070b8427d2"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1. MEDIUM (Red-Team 5c) — replay never checked the resolving disposition's driver identity",
          "anchor": "1-medium-red-team-5c-replay-never-checked-the-resolving-dispositions-driver-identity",
          "githubAnchor": "1-medium-red-team-5c-replay-never-checked-the-resolving-dispositions-driver-identity",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1a9e0aa8e78f"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "2. MEDIUM (Reviewer MEDIUM-1) — a bare contribution id was accepted, shown as owned, and resolved nothing",
          "anchor": "2-medium-reviewer-medium-1-a-bare-contribution-id-was-accepted-shown-as-owned-and-resolved-nothing",
          "githubAnchor": "2-medium-reviewer-medium-1-a-bare-contribution-id-was-accepted-shown-as-owned-and-resolved-nothing",
          "stableAnchor": "h-df553725b063"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "3. MEDIUM (Reviewer MEDIUM-2 / Red-Team 5d) — replay's derivation was order-blind",
          "anchor": "3-medium-reviewer-medium-2-red-team-5d-replays-derivation-was-order-blind",
          "githubAnchor": "3-medium-reviewer-medium-2-red-team-5d-replays-derivation-was-order-blind",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b008531ea355"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "4. MEDIUM (Red-Team 4c) — the window was checked at LINK time, not at REASONING time",
          "anchor": "4-medium-red-team-4c-the-window-was-checked-at-link-time-not-at-reasoning-time",
          "githubAnchor": "4-medium-red-team-4c-the-window-was-checked-at-link-time-not-at-reasoning-time",
          "stableAnchor": "h-d1f0e41771d7"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "5. LOW-MEDIUM (Red-Team 3b) — unbounded verbatim strings into the immutable ledger",
          "anchor": "5-low-medium-red-team-3b-unbounded-verbatim-strings-into-the-immutable-ledger",
          "githubAnchor": "5-low-medium-red-team-3b-unbounded-verbatim-strings-into-the-immutable-ledger",
          "stableAnchor": "h-63e34d1baf4a"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "6. LOW (Reviewer LOW-1 / Red-Team 1c) — `contributionId` had no shape constraint",
          "anchor": "6-low-reviewer-low-1-red-team-1c-contributionid-had-no-shape-constraint",
          "githubAnchor": "6-low-reviewer-low-1-red-team-1c-contributionid-had-no-shape-constraint",
          "stableAnchor": "h-955f8ba12888"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "7. MEDIUM (Reviewer MEDIUM-3, test-only) — the raw door's legality boundary was unpinned",
          "anchor": "7-medium-reviewer-medium-3-test-only-the-raw-doors-legality-boundary-was-unpinned",
          "githubAnchor": "7-medium-reviewer-medium-3-test-only-the-raw-doors-legality-boundary-was-unpinned",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4d5c40e59c0a"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "8. LOW (Reviewer LOW-2) — the third copy of the ownership rule. **Decision: branch added.**",
          "anchor": "8-low-reviewer-low-2-the-third-copy-of-the-ownership-rule-decision-branch-added",
          "githubAnchor": "8-low-reviewer-low-2-the-third-copy-of-the-ownership-rule-decision-branch-added",
          "stableAnchor": "h-3e8a92bd563b"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "9. LOW (Reviewer LOW-3) — the static signature test's capture",
          "anchor": "9-low-reviewer-low-3-the-static-signature-tests-capture",
          "githubAnchor": "9-low-reviewer-low-3-the-static-signature-tests-capture",
          "stableAnchor": "h-fda39784d34e"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "10. INFO (Red-Team 5e) — the disposition-value enum, stated as a modeling choice",
