          "stableAnchor": "h-0fa59eb9187f"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Part 1 — Disposition checklist (§6), item by item",
          "anchor": "part-1-disposition-checklist-6-item-by-item",
          "githubAnchor": "part-1-disposition-checklist-6-item-by-item",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b1f604a8a361"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "HIGH-1 — resolution failure degrades to `definition = null` — **VERIFIED (with N1 below)**",
          "anchor": "high-1-resolution-failure-degrades-to-definition-null-verified-with-n1-below",
          "githubAnchor": "high-1-resolution-failure-degrades-to-definition-null-verified-with-n1-below",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1bf5b5e0aedc"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "HIGH-2 — version drift — **VERIFIED on (a) and (b); (c) is a real new problem, see N2**",
          "anchor": "high-2-version-drift-verified-on-a-and-b-c-is-a-real-new-problem-see-n2",
          "githubAnchor": "high-2-version-drift-verified-on-a-and-b-c-is-a-real-new-problem-see-n2",
          "stableAnchor": "h-02ddf11c1f8c"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "HIGH-3 — false \"byte-identical\" claim corrected — **VERIFIED**",
          "anchor": "high-3-false-byte-identical-claim-corrected-verified",
          "githubAnchor": "high-3-false-byte-identical-claim-corrected-verified",
          "stableAnchor": "h-38befc0c53f6"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "HIGH-4 — quorum coverage for the 5 dark protocols — **VERIFIED, tests are genuine**",
          "anchor": "high-4-quorum-coverage-for-the-5-dark-protocols-verified-tests-are-genuine",
          "githubAnchor": "high-4-quorum-coverage-for-the-5-dark-protocols-verified-tests-are-genuine",
          "stableAnchor": "h-aef2baa1b999"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM-5 — aggregation exclusion keyed on actor+operation — **VERIFIED**",
          "anchor": "medium-5-aggregation-exclusion-keyed-on-actoroperation-verified",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-5-aggregation-exclusion-keyed-on-actoroperation-verified",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a685e863e271"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM-6, LOW-8 — present in §5 Gaps — **VERIFIED**",
          "anchor": "medium-6-low-8-present-in-5-gaps-verified",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-6-low-8-present-in-5-gaps-verified",
          "stableAnchor": "h-6cde2cf604d3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM-7 — contained fix genuinely unreachable — **VERIFIED**",
          "anchor": "medium-7-contained-fix-genuinely-unreachable-verified",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-7-contained-fix-genuinely-unreachable-verified",
          "stableAnchor": "h-8694c3a36d5d"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "INFO-9 — nothing silently changed — **VERIFIED**",
          "anchor": "info-9-nothing-silently-changed-verified",
          "githubAnchor": "info-9-nothing-silently-changed-verified",
          "stableAnchor": "h-08dc8573722a"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Part 2 — New findings",
          "anchor": "part-2-new-findings",
          "githubAnchor": "part-2-new-findings",
          "stableAnchor": "h-5115c49f3f24"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "N1 (HIGH) — HIGH-1's fail-open degradation reintroduces the exact premature-close bug this cell exists to eliminate",
          "anchor": "n1-high-high-1s-fail-open-degradation-reintroduces-the-exact-premature-close-bug-this-cell-exists-to-eliminate",
          "githubAnchor": "n1-high-high-1s-fail-open-degradation-reintroduces-the-exact-premature-close-bug-this-cell-exists-to-eliminate",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a8e0625f58bd"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "N2 (MEDIUM) — the read path is now silently wrong under version drift, and the report states the opposite",
          "anchor": "n2-medium-the-read-path-is-now-silently-wrong-under-version-drift-and-the-report-states-the-opposite",
          "githubAnchor": "n2-medium-the-read-path-is-now-silently-wrong-under-version-drift-and-the-report-states-the-opposite",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9a04ba5523aa"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "N3 (MEDIUM) — HIGH-1 is fixed for `show`, not for `run`; the remaining half is not named",
          "anchor": "n3-medium-high-1-is-fixed-for-show-not-for-run-the-remaining-half-is-not-named",
          "githubAnchor": "n3-medium-high-1-is-fixed-for-show-not-for-run-the-remaining-half-is-not-named",
          "stableAnchor": "h-70728b743a9b"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "N4 (LOW) — which actor gets the aggregation exclusion is decided by graph authoring order",
          "anchor": "n4-low-which-actor-gets-the-aggregation-exclusion-is-decided-by-graph-authoring-order",
          "githubAnchor": "n4-low-which-actor-gets-the-aggregation-exclusion-is-decided-by-graph-authoring-order",
