          "githubAnchor": "r2-1-medium-5s-n3-gap-misstates-its-own-scope-and-n1s-user-visible-fix-does-not-land-on-the-run-verb",
          "stableAnchor": "h-381030580da0"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "R2-2 (MEDIUM) — §7.5 was corrected for the count but left stale in four other ways",
